# Time-of-day Places-text fallback. Long stops trigger a second pass through
# `places:searchText` with a bucket-appropriate query, so e.g. a 22:00 stop
# explicitly searches for bars/music-venues even if the nearest indexed place
# is a sushi restaurant. Hours are the home zone's (HOME_TZ).
